  "obsah": "<div class=\"hero sm\" style=\"background-image:url('{{foto:budova}}')\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a></div><span class=\"ey\" style=\"color:#ffd3a8\">Contact</span><h1>Contact</h1><p>Chmelnice, Vranov reservoir.</p></div></div><section><div class=\"in two\"><div class=\"box\"><h3>Address</h3><p>Panelcz<br>Oslnovice ev. č. 51, osada Chmelnice<br>671 07 Uherčice<br>GPS: 48.9328522N, 15.7103475E</p><p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=48.9328522,15.7103475\" target=\"_blank\">Open in map</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>Phone and e-mail</h3><p>Accommodation: <a href=\"tel:+420775704669\">+420 775 704 669</a><br>Operations: <a href=\"tel:+420775704711\">+420 775 704 711</a><br>E-mail: <a href=\"mailto:info@panelcz.cz\">info@panelcz.cz</a></p><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px\">Operator</h3><p>Dajpr s.r.o., company ID 05753040<br>Nové Syrovice 141, 675 41 Nové Syrovice</p></div></div></section><section class=\"alt\" id=\"poptavka\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"head\"><span class=\"ey\">Enquiry</span><h2>Write to us</h2><p>A stay for your whole group, a party, a company event or a visit to see the complex. Tell us what you are planning and we will get back to you. This does not book anything.</p></div><div class=\"box kp\"><form class=\"pf gf\" novalidate data-email=\"info@panelcz.cz\" data-tel=\"+420 775 704 669\"><div class=\"kr2\"><label>Full name (required)<input name=\"jmeno\" autocomplete=\"name\" required></label><label>Phone<input name=\"telefon\" type=\"tel\" autocomplete=\"tel\"></label></div><div class=\"kr2\"><label>E-mail (required)<input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required></label><label>Dates (or just the month for now)<input name=\"termin\" placeholder=\"e.g. 12–14 March 2027\"></label></div><div class=\"kr2\"><label>What are you planning<select name=\"co\"><option value=\"pobyt\">A stay for the whole group</option><option value=\"oslava\">A party, birthday or stag/hen party</option><option value=\"firma\">A company event or team building</option><option value=\"svatba\">A wedding</option><option value=\"prohlidka\">A visit to see the complex</option><option value=\"jine\">Something else</option></select></label><label>How many people<input name=\"osob\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"150\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\"></label></div><label class=\"chk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"prohlidka\"><span>I would like to arrange a visit to see the complex</span></label><label>Message<textarea name=\"zprava\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"What would you like to ask? For example how many guests are coming to the party, how many will stay overnight, or whether you would like catering.\"></textarea></label><input type=\"text\" name=\"_honey\" class=\"hp\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Send message</button><p class=\"pf-stav\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><p class=\"tnote\">This does not book anything, and we will e-mail you a copy of your message. We only use your personal data to reply, more in our <a href=\"/en/gdpr/\">Privacy policy</a>. You can work out the cost of a wedding in the <a href=\"/en/svatby/#kalkulacka\">calculator on the Weddings page</a>.</p></form></div></div></section>"
}